Arc is the way to go if you want to boot directly from the HDD.  
You'll need a small FAT partition which ARC can see, and stick the  
loader and perhaps kernel image in there. There are some instalation  
howto's on the web. I'm not sure where the best place to get these  
from is, but if you don't have much luck email me personally and I'll  
send you  my loader and milo that works for a 2.4.

Doing a netboot to start is probably the easiest way to get the  
install going.


